    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36514" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑξᾰγων-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hexagonal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Hyp.</u>
				1.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				419.14
			</span></i>; <i>of a hexagon,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλευραί</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				57.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. ἀριθμοί,</span> of a kind of
			figurate numbers, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.60P.
			</span></i>: Astrol., <i>sextile,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paul.Al.
				<u>R.</u>
				3
			</span></i>; also of the moon's phase, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				9.902
			</span></i>.</div>
